        <UserObject label="" tooltip="First complete product demonstration — FUTURE / NOT RUN&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=cap-demo`&#10;&#10;One requested native capability: discovery then binding then UI or Lua then prepared scenario, independent state observation then verified supported restoration then useful recorded clip. Behavior, capture integrity and presentation are separate acceptance predicates. A job result, syntax pass, browser shell or Wasm utility does not prove this delivery. Source parity, native game behavior and platform qualification keep separate receipts." link="autonomous-capabilities.outline.md#cap-demo" id="cap-demo"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L3"><mxGeometry x="35" y="1115" width="1115" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
