        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Human input only for genuine exceptions&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=cap-human`&#10;&#10;Material objective / acceptance changes; unavailable legal, credential or device access; required external interaction; uninferable subjective creative direction. Deduplicate requests; continue independent work. Local artifact creation is not external publication authority.&#10;&#10;Design status: M1 to M7 are ambitions, not completed features. M0 software evidence does not establish live-game autonomy. In the app: `?node=cap-footer`&#10;&#10;Contract: docs/plans/2026-09-22-autonomous-capability-product-roadmap.md, 2026-09-22" link="autonomous-capabilities.outline.md#cap-human" id="cap-human"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L3"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="1115" width="595" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
